1. PURPOSE.  The E3 trajectory log for the qwen14b arm (/home/ziheng/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--Qwen--Qwen3-14B/snapshots/40c069824f4251a91eefaf281ebe4c544efd3e18): 240 items x
